{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-03-21 07:18:00', 'title': 'CENTENE RECOGNIZED WITH INNOVATION AWARD FOR HEALTH EQUITY', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS , MARCH 21, 2022 \xa0/PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) ("CENTENE") ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN AWARDED THE INNOVATION AWARD FOR HEALTH EQUITY BY THE NATIONAL COMMITTEE FOR QUALITY ASSURANCE (NCQA). THE AWARD RECOGNIZES CENTENE\'S DATA-DRIVEN HEALTH EQUITY IMPROVEMENT MODEL FOR BEING A LEADING-EDGE STRATEGY FOR IMPROVING HEALTH EQUITY AND HEALTHCARE QUALITY THROUGH INNOVATIVE AND CREATIVE SOLUTIONS.'}